            "text": "event: start\ndata: {\"session_id\": \"951915d6-699b-40e3-a704-85119c758d89\", \"model_id\": \"gpt-5.6-luna\", \"web_search_results\": [{\"index\": 1, \"label\": \"W1\", \"title\": \"Smart Search & Web Browser - Apps on Google Play\", \"link\": \"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=reactivephone.msearch&hl=en_US\", \"display_link\": \"play.google.com\", \"snippet\": \"Smart Search and fast Web Browser with voice search will help you quickly find any website, beautiful images, videos and favourite music from Web. Download this ...\"}, {\"index\": 2, \"label\": \"W2\", \"title\": \"How to disable internet search on computer search? - Google Help\", \"link\": \"https://support.google.com/chromebook/thread/74592281/how-to-disable-internet-search-on-computer-search?hl=en\", \"display_link\": \"support.google.com\", \"snippet\": \"Oct 2, 2020 ... How do I disable the web search from this bar and ONLY have it search my computer each time? This seems pointless with a search bar up top, and ...\"}, {\"index\": 3, \"label\": \"W3\", \"title\": \"Internet Browser - Apps on Google Play\", \"link\": \"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.heytap.browser&hl=en_US\", \"display_link\": \"play.google.com\", \"snippet\": \"Internet browser, security and stability guaranteed, and the perfect Combination of the system, give you the best experience, provide a wealth of news and ...\"}, {\"index\": 4, \"label\": \"W4\", \"title\": \"Remove my private info from Google Search\", \"link\": \"https://support.google.com/websearch/answer/9673730?hl=en\", \"display_link\": \"support.google.com\", \"snippet\": \"Even if Google removes something from Google Search, it might still be on the internet. People might still find it through links, social media, or other search ...\"}, {\"index\": 5, \"label\": \"W5\", \"title\": \"Googling “Inflation”: What does Internet Search Behaviour Reveal ...\", \"link\": \"https://economy-finance.ec.europa.eu/publications/googling-inflation-what-does-internet-search-behaviour-reveal-about-household-inattention-inflation_en\", \"display_link\": \"economy-finance.ec.europa.eu\", \"snippet\": \"Mar 27, 2023 ... This paper assesses determinants of inflation attention, measured by internet search-behaviour, across euro area countries. Information and ...\"}, {\"index\": 6, \"label\": \"W6\", \"title\": \"Internet use by the public to search for health-related information\", \"link\": \"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/22217800/\", \"display_link\": \"pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\", \"snippet\": \"Background: The use of the Internet to search for health-related information (HRI) has become a common practice worldwide. Our literature review failed to ...\"}, {\"index\": 7, \"label\": \"W7\", \"title\": \"A search engine that doesn't scrape the top 30 websites on ... - Reddit\", \"link\": \"https://www.reddit.com/r/degoogle/comments/1j6l2zs/a_search_engine_that_doesnt_scrape_the_top_30/\", \"display_link\": \"www.reddit.com\", \"snippet\": \"Mar 8, 2025 ... Or at least a button I can press after making a search that's like a \\\"dig deeper\\\" search, or a \\\"small web\\\" search, or a \\\"wider internet\\\" search.\"}, {\"index\": 8, \"label\": \"W8\", \"title\": \"Infodemiology and infoveillance: framework for an emerging set of ...\", \"link\": \"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/19329408/\", \"display_link\": \"pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\", \"snippet\": \"Mar 27, 2009 ... Examples for infodemiology applications include the analysis of queries from Internet search engines to predict disease outbreaks (eg.\"}, {\"index\": 9, \"label\": \"W9\", \"title\": \"In-Depth Guide to How Google Search Works | Documentation\", \"link\": \"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/how-search-works\", \"display_link\": \"developers.google.com\", \"snippet\": \"Google Search is a fully-automated search engine that uses software known as web crawlers that explore the web regularly to find pages to add to our index.\"}, {\"index\": 10, \"label\": \"W10\", \"title\": \"Access to care and use of the Internet to search for health information\", \"link\": \"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25925943/\", \"display_link\": \"pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\", \"snippet\": \"Apr 29, 2015 ... Adults who reported difficulty accessing health care services for reasons unrelated to their health insurance coverage had greater odds of using ...\"}], \"warnings\": [], \"has_images\": false}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \"I\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \" searched\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \" the\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \" available\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \" web\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \" results\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \" for\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \" **\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \"GPT\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \"‑\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \"5\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \".\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \"6\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \" Luna\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \"**,\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \" **\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \"GPT\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \"‑\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \"5\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \".\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \"6\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \" Terra\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \"**,\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \" and\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \" **\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \"GPT\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \"‑\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \"6\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \".\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \"1\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \"Q\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \" Sol\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \"**,\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \" but\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\": \" found\"}\n\nevent: delta