rowser - Apps on Google Play\", \"link\": \"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.heytap.browser&hl=en_US\", \"display_link\": \"play.google.com\", \"snippet\": \"Internet browser, security and stability guaranteed, and the perfect Combination of the system, give you the best experience, provide a wealth of news and ...\"}, {\"index\": 9, \"label\": \"W9\", \"title\": \"In-Depth Guide to How Google Search Works | Documentation\", \"link\": \"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/how-search-works\", \"display_link\": \"developers.google.com\", \"snippet\": \"Google Search is a fully-automated search engine that uses software known as web crawlers that explore the web regularly to find pages to add to our index.\"}], \"token_estimates\": {\"user\": 3, \"assistant\": 156, \"images\": 0}}\n\n"
